# baresip account for the Judicom.  Copy to /home/joe/.baresip/accounts and put the password of the "judicom-auth" section of
# judicom.conf on the NAS in place of CHANGE_ME.  100.64.0.1 is the NAS's Tailscale address.  The real file is not kept in git.
<sip:judicom@100.64.0.1:5060;transport=udp>;auth_user=judicom;auth_pass=CHANGE_ME;regint=60
